cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use IndetBench in research, please cite the software and the applicable third-party methods, datasets and models listed in docs/REFERENCES.md and docs/REFERENCES.bib."
type: software
title: "IndetBench: A Benchmark for Answer Determinability in Language Models"
abstract: "A reproducible benchmark and validation protocol for answer determinability in language models: paired variants in which the answer is determined (B) or not determined (C), used to test whether uncertainty estimators and probes rank C above B. All code was generated with AI tools under the author's direction; see docs/AI_USAGE.md."
authors:
